<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tollgrade EPS view upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tollgrade EPS view upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said it raised its 1998 earnings estimate on Tollgrade Communications Inc to $1.32 per share from $1.28.</p>
<p>-- Kept fiscal 1997 earnings estimate at $1.10 per share.</p>
<p>-- Kept short-term buy and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 19-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
